### **Summary Table**

| Goal/Task | Relation | Justification |
|-----------|----------|---------------|
| **G1 -> G2, G3** | AND | Both checking inpatient ability and delivering via appropriate method are required. |
| **G3 -> G4, G5** | OR | Either method (inpatient fetch or robot placement) can achieve delivery. |
| **G4 -> AT2, AT3, AT4, AT5** | AND | All tasks are required to deliver via inpatient fetch. |
| **G5 -> AT6, AT7, AT8** | AND | All tasks are required to deliver via robot placement. |
| **G7 -> AT9, AT10, AT11** | AND | All tasks are required to retrieve dirty dishes. |
